usage: verify_studio_connect_four_android.py [-h] --source-sha SOURCE_SHA
                                             --native-sha NATIVE_SHA
                                             --artifact-digest ARTIFACT_DIGEST
                                             --apk-sha256 APK_SHA256
                                             --pck-sha256 PCK_SHA256
                                             --build-run BUILD_RUN
                                             --artifact-id ARTIFACT_ID
                                             --native-source NATIVE_SOURCE
                                             --metadata-dir METADATA_DIR
                                             --api35 API35 --api37 API37
                                             --main-tour35 MAIN_TOUR35
                                             --main-tour37 MAIN_TOUR37
                                             --runtime RUNTIME --out OUT

Recheck current Studio2020 C4 originals before publication. No emulator, rule
engine, APK installation or test process is started here. Current GitHub
metadata binds the uploaded originals to the current jobs; recorded states,
readbacks, pixels, touches, saves and leases are re-evaluated. The separate
real Dart/Godot gate remains mandatory and is never replaced by the renderer-
only Visualfixture or by a successful older Android candidate.

